### Bug fixes

* Fix `InvalidMatchSpec` when parsing list-style `extras`/`flags` (e.g. `httpx2[extras=[cli,http2]]`)
  with solvers other than `rattler`, by always using the v3 MatchSpec parser. (#16724 via #16906)
* Fix `MatchSpec` silently ignoring the version constraint in bracketed expressions without an `=`
  separator (e.g. `numpy[version<2]`) with solvers other than `rattler`. (#16724 via #16906)

